FunnyLang (native) -- it compiles. somehow.
usage: funny [--serious] [--no-color] [--time] [--vibes] [run] <file> [args...]
       funny build <file> -o <out>
       funny yeet <file.funny> [-o <out>]
       funny xray <file> [--tokens] [--ast] [--pak]
       funny fmt <file> [--check]
       funny test <dir>
       funny vibe
  <file> may be .funny (compiled on the spot), .funnyc, or .funnypak.

unknown -> exit 1
